  "descriptions": [
    "Pipedreams is a spacious Gulf Shores vacation rental designed for large gatherings, multi-family vacations, and group retreats along Alabama’s sugar-white coastline. Located near the beaches of Gulf Shores, this expansive private beach home offers generous sleeping capacity, open living spaces, and the comfort needed for extended coastal stays.",
    "Designed to accommodate up to 20 guests, Pipedreams features multiple bedrooms and baths, allowing everyone to spread out while still enjoying shared living areas perfect for dining, relaxing, and reconnecting. The fully equipped kitchen makes meal preparation easy, whether you're hosting a seafood night after a day on the beach or preparing breakfast before heading out to explore.",
    "Natural light, coastal décor, and thoughtfully designed gathering spaces create a welcoming atmosphere for: Family reunions, Wedding parties, Corporate retreats, Multi-generation vacations, and Group beach celebrations. Its Gulf Shores location places you within minutes of public beach access, local dining, outdoor recreation, and family attractions — making it both peaceful and convenient. If you're searching for a large Gulf Shores beach house rental that combines space, comfort, and proximity to the Gulf, Pipedreams delivers a memorable Alabama Gulf Coast experience."
  ],
